WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.833
(crowd murmuring)

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:08.846
Ugh, this Nebula Strike
panel line's taking forever.

00:00:08.846 --> 00:00:09.740
Uh, yeah.

00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:11.730
It's taking longer than
when Corporal Snerdax

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:13.610
took his Galaxy Cruisers
to the Glorp System

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:15.740
to capture the Sporence traders
who had kidnapped Prolona

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:17.820
the Star Inquisitor, because
she had ruled against them

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:19.610
in the High Galactic
Court of Lumander Five,

00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:21.020
because she had received a Blorff payoff

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:23.050
from the Delta Faction who
were trying to use the courts

00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:24.490
to legitimize their hostile takeover

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:26.738
of the Encordium mines on
Dierkson's moon, Ontank.

00:00:26.738 --> 00:00:29.710
I think you mean this
line is taking longer than

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:31.900
when Corporal Snerdax
took his Galaxy Cruisers

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:34.990
to the Klammen System to
capture the Sporence traders

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:36.589
who had kidnapped Prolona
the Star Inquisitor,

00:00:36.589 --> 00:00:37.820
because she had ruled against them

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:39.490
in the High Galactic
Court of Lumander Five,

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:41.130
because she had received a Blorff payoff

00:00:41.130 --> 00:00:43.008
from the Delta Faction who
were trying to use the courts

00:00:43.008 --> 00:00:44.730
to legitimize their hostile takeover

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:46.970
of the Encordium mines on
Dierkson's moon, Ontank.

00:00:46.970 --> 00:00:48.740
So, that's what you meant.

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:50.690
The Klammon system is actually very close

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:52.460
to Corporal Snerdax's home planet Junda,

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:54.380
which means that, using
the Galaxy Cruisers

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:57.210
Ion Tripler Engines, that, the
Yepping engineers developed

00:00:57.210 --> 00:01:00.160
on Junda's moon, Carom,
from the Torium deposits,

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:01.578
it would actually take Corporal Snerdax

00:01:01.578 --> 00:01:03.650
three milliseconds to synthwarp there,

00:01:03.650 --> 00:01:07.020
which is in no way representative
of this very slow line.

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:10.330
What you meant to say, sir,
is that the Klammon system

00:01:10.330 --> 00:01:12.230
is actually very close
to Corporal Snerdax's

00:01:12.230 --> 00:01:13.810
home planet Junda, which means that,

00:01:13.810 --> 00:01:16.440
using the Ion Tripler Engines,
that the Yepping engineers

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:17.810
on the Junda's moon, Carom, developed

00:01:17.810 --> 00:01:21.020
from the Ladium deposits,
it would only take

00:01:21.020 --> 00:01:22.960
Corporal Snerdax three
milliseconds to synthwarp,

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:25.890
which is in no way representative
of this very slow line.

00:01:25.890 --> 00:01:27.080
I'll kick your ass worse than when

00:01:27.080 --> 00:01:28.850
Lumander Five Venture
Brigade flew to Dierkson

00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:30.060
to beat the Outer Brigands.

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:31.660
You mean you'll kick
my ass worse than when

00:01:31.660 --> 00:01:34.230
Lumander Five Venture
Brigade flew to Ontank

00:01:34.230 --> 00:01:35.665
to beat the Outer Brigands.

00:01:35.665 --> 00:01:40.200
Hey, hey hey, stop, whoa
whoa whoa take it easy!

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:42.240
We all love the Nebula Strike movies.

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:44.283
Here, have a Snickers.

00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:47.300
