of Sporence traders.

00:01:54.770 --> 00:01:57.210
Totally agree that Snerdax's
indiscriminate slaughter

00:01:57.210 --> 00:01:58.230
was very cool.

00:01:58.230 --> 00:02:00.440
Yeah, he really did wipe
out that entire planet,

00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:02.700
and every living soul on it, didn't he?

00:02:02.700 --> 00:02:04.000
He sure did.

